</mxCell><mxCell id="pg4-73" value="Prasyarat: Partner login lebih dulu; &lt;i&gt;partnerRestoId&lt;/i&gt; disimpan di localStorage dan dipakai untuk memfilter data restoran." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1420" y="890" width="320" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pg4-74" value="Tempatkan / Pindahkan / Selesaikan Sesi Meja memperbarui &lt;i&gt;seatoOccupied&lt;/i&gt; atau &lt;i&gt;walkInOccupied&lt;/i&gt; serta &lt;i&gt;tableAssignments&lt;/i&gt; melalui PATCH /api/restaurants/{id}/areas (divalidasi terhadap kuota)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1420" y="970" width="320" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pg4-75" value="Pengingat muncul untuk meja &lt;b&gt;walk-in&lt;/b&gt; yang melewati batas waktu (10 detik untuk pengujian); Partner memilih &lt;i&gt;Masih (Reset)&lt;/i&gt; atau &lt;i&gt;Sudah Selesai&lt;/i&gt;." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#FFFDE7;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1420" y="1070" width="320" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="pg5" name="UC-05 Super Admin &amp; Cron"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1710" pageHeight="1169" background="#FFFFFF" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="pg5-1" value="UC-05 · Use Case Diagram – Super Admin &amp;amp; Tugas Terjadwal (Vercel Cron)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalA